<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Akun Anda Sudah Aktif</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #202124;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .steps {
            margin: 0 0 24px;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .steps li {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .notice-box {
            background-color: #fef7e0;
            border: 1px solid #fdd663;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .notice-box p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .button-container {
            background: #25d366;
            width: max-content;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .preheader {
            display: none !important;
            visibility: hidden;
            opacity: 0;
            color: transparent;
            height: 0;
            width: 0;
            max-height: 0;
            max-width: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            mso-hide: all;
            font-size: 1px;
            line-height: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="preheader">Setup geofence pertama cuma butuh 5 menit.</div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">
            <h1>Akun Anda Sudah Aktif</h1>
            <p>Halo {{firstName}},</p>
            <p>Akun Timemoz Anda sudah aktif, tanpa kartu kredit, tanpa kontrak mengikat.</p>
            <p>Biar hari pertama langsung kelihatan hasilnya, mulai dari 3 langkah ini:</p>
            <ol class="steps">
                <li><strong>Set geofence outlet pertama</strong> : radius 12m, tiap check-in sales otomatis tervalidasi lokasi + foto GPS.</li>
                <li><strong>Buat rencana kunjungan (beat plan)</strong> : rute tim tersusun, overdue visit langsung ketahuan di dashboard.</li>
                <li><strong>Aktifkan mode offline</strong> : data kunjungan tetap masuk walau tim ada di blank spot sinyal, auto-sync begitu online.</li>
            </ol>
            <div class="notice-box">
                <p>Semua data tim Anda terenkripsi AES-256, tersimpan di server Tier-3 Jakarta, sesuai UU PDP No 27/2022.</p>
            </div>
            <p>Butuh bantuan setup? Tim kami siap dampingi langsung.</p>
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                    <td align="center">
                        <div class="button-container">
                            <!-- Triple-stache: URL-nya konstanta di MailService (bukan input user),
                                 dan escape Handlebars mengubah `=` jadi `&#x3D;` di dalam href. -->
                            <a href="{{{whatsappUrl}}}" class="button" style="color: #fff; text-decoration: none;">👉 Lanjut Konsultasi via WhatsApp</a>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <p style="margin-top: 24px;">Salam,<br />Tim Timemoz</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
